--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following files are taken from mfm-js (https://github.com/misskey-dev/mfm.js)
so that this library keeps the same interface and passes the same tests:

- test/parser.ts, test/api.ts (the test suite, as is)
- src/index.ts (the list of the exports)
- the type definitions and the factory functions in src/node.ts, the comments of
  the functions in src/api.ts

